```spl
`SOC Lab Detection Rule`
`Rule Name: Sysmon PowerShell Process Execution & Lineage Investigation`
`Event ID: 1 (Process Create)`
`MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001 (PowerShell)`
`Severity: Medium`
`Data Source: XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | index=blue`
`Description: Investigates instances of powershell.exe or pwsh.exe execution, displaying parent processes, full command line, and process GUIDs.`
```

index=blue EventCode=1
| search Image="*powershell.exe" OR Image="*pwsh.exe"
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine ProcessGuid ParentProcessGuid
| sort - _time
